    "summary": "Ran the cross-cutting proof and turned daemon threads on by default. Flipping the default exposed three defects, all fixed: (1) the @lancedb/lancedb cross-thread crash, fixed by upgrading 0.27.2 to 0.40.0, with a regression test that fails on 0.27.2; (2) index-run figures and registry status not reaching other threads; (3) a race in their publish order. The two failures that predated s2 were fixed as tracked bugs: ISSUE-cf81a4e9 (temporalTrend overflow) and ISSUE-47cc3068 (review-decision test path). The full sweep, run file by file, passes 681 of 681 files and 6,073 tests; the log is in docs/epics/multi-threaded-daemon-sessions-admin-indexing-E2026102186197ac6/S002/evidence/t17-full-sweep.md (commit 3d98673a). The daemon-ctl smoke test passed against the compiled threaded daemon.",
